                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I bought this little visual novel as soon it was released on Steam, and even if I disliked the developer’s previous work (Aozora Meikyuu) I wanted to give them another chance.\n\nAnd well. Turns out I didn’t liked this title either. The art style is pretty tho, I enjoyed it. But the story seemed somewhat interesting at first and turned out to be a complete disappointing. A few dialogues are funny to read, but for that price, it simply isn’t worth it. Also, both routes are very different from each other, it’s like two separated stories. And both were badly writen. Hotaru’s ending was a bit more interesting, but it felt rushed and incomplete.\n\n3/10. Wait for this title to get in a bundle and try it out, at least that’s my recommendation.",
